# Workspace root marker. Left commented on purpose: a bare git-clone should
# NOT trigger workspace behaviour. `install.sh --type WORKSPACE` adds an active
# WORKSPACE=true to the .env it seeds. When set, `femur` defaults --output-dir
# to ./data and --log-file to ./logs/ (relative to this .env's directory).
# WORKSPACE=true
